  "summary": {
    "text": "Zephyr 7B β is the second model in Hugging Face's Zephyr series, a 7B chat assistant fine-tuned from Mistral 7B v0.1 and published as open weights under the MIT licence. Its technical report describes distilled supervised fine-tuning followed by distilled preference optimization on AI feedback, without human annotation; the training code followed in the Alignment Handbook.",
